{
	"name": "EveryPage gated leads → CRM",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Gated leads → CRM\nWhen a viewer completes the **email gate or lead-capture form** on a document (Pro), the signed webhook fires instantly and the captured fields land wherever your pipeline lives.\n\nReplace the Slack step with HubSpot / Pipedrive / Google Sheets — the lead's email is on `{{ $json.email }}`, the full form capture on `{{ $json.fields }}`.\n\n**Firewalled self-host?** Switch the trigger's mode to *Poll* — same events, pulled on a schedule.",
				"height": 300,
				"width": 400
			},
			"id": "b2c3d4e5-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
			"name": "Sticky Note",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-240, -220]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"triggerMode": "webhook",
				"events": ["gate.completed"],
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "b2c3d4e5-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
			"name": "EveryPage Trigger",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-everypage.everyPageTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"webhookId": "b2c3d4e5-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000099",
			"position": [-240, 80]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"assignments": {
					"assignments": [
						{
							"id": "lead-email",
							"name": "email",
							"value": "={{ $json.email }}",
							"type": "string"
						},
						{
							"id": "lead-doc",
							"name": "document",
							"value": "={{ $json.fileName }}",
							"type": "string"
						},
						{
							"id": "lead-at",
